                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts356" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts357">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Other or, you know, or also living with the fear of passing it on, which is a huge thing that you don't just don't realise that you're carrying all the time.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
