        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a767"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts316" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts318">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Uh in the show you asked the question.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
        <ANNOTATION>
            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a768"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts330" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts340">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>I don't think it plays that big a role in our relationship. You know, I've been very public about my diagnosis after all those years, maybe 15 years, without telling anyone. You know, so you kind of came with the knowledge. And I don't know, maybe there's just the way in which everything had changed as well in the world, you know, prep and undetectable equals untransmittable. And it was a new us going, well, the point where we went into our relationship, everything had changed.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
            </ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION>
        </ANNOTATION>
