            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a771"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts354" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts364">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Othered, or you know, or also living with the fear of passing it on, which is a huge thing that you don't just don't realize that you're carrying all the time. But then, new fears of going, like, oh gosh, I've only ever known that, and now I've got this client saying, Oh, you can have sex without a condom, and it will be fine. But the thing that made me realize.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
