            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a772"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts366" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts374">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Was special or different was that you held the conversation for me. When we finally met, and then it was clear that it was gonna, you know, get physical. You said, I'm on prep, how do you want to go about it? or something like that. And I realized at then that that was one of the first times that someone had actually.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
