                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts386" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts390">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>20s, and kind of, you know, around close to the time when I was diagnosed, the terror of having to tell someone and fear in that rejection. That just made me realize how much people.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
