            <ALIGNABLE_ANNOTATION ANNOTATION_ID="a777"
                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts396" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts400">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>But that has shifted and I think there is a whole generation of gay and bisexual men in particular who are really embracing PrEP and going, I'm taking control and I'm responsible for stopping the spread of the virus as well. Sharing that weight of responsibility feels easier.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
