                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts552" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts558">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>For nearly 15 years, I didn't tell my family, like, and that I shut a whole world of help and support out[mhh]. And that's the one thing I do say to people:[laugh]</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
