                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts570" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts578">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Open, and I understand the privilege that I have being able to be fully open by my diagnosis. And I want a world where everyone can be, but I understand that not everyone can. But I would say,</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
