                TIME_SLOT_REF1="ts584" TIME_SLOT_REF2="ts592">
                <ANNOTATION_VALUE>Don't don't believe the bullshit that you deserve this or that you are a second rate citizen or that you should be ashamed or r regardless of how you got it. So I I I kind of have a lot of compassion for why I couldn't say it.</ANNOTATION_VALUE>
